The '''Shredded Sinew''' is a {{Legendary}} item dropped from the {{SlayerTier|5}} {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}}. It is used to craft the {{Item|Halberd of the Shredded}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
The '''Shredded Sinew''' is an {{odds|rng|no=yes}} drop from the {{SlayerTier|5}} Revenant Horror. It has a {{Green|0.06%}} chance to drop if the player has {{CollectionLink|Zombie Slayer LVL 7}} <!-- Maddox says LVL 7, API and tooltip say LVL 8 -->or above.

